      "updated": 1768454846170,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "INTERRELATE",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "INTERRELATE",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "WEbkIiCQjEe8ZA_V-fdua",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5455.175056692974,
      "y": -107.85453107696594,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c91P",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 771966283,
      "version": 424,
      "versionNonce": 79286662,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768454846170,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "具体的な疑問や不安が出てきたときに、手早く「部分的な」スケッチを描く。\n全体像ではなく、解決したいポイントに絞る。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "具体的な疑問や不安が出てきたときに、手早く「部分的な」スケッチを描く。\n全体像ではなく、解決したいポイントに絞る。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "DAUNmjxlgzadKBNKASMN-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11638.629419848918,
      "y": -57.72332308172713,
      "width": 780,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c91Q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1672779339,
      "version": 325,
      "versionNonce": 430600666,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768454846170,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "アイデアやセクションを円形に並べ、因果関係（どれが他を助けるか）で矢印を引く。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "アイデアやセクションを円形に並べ、因果関係（どれが他を助けるか）で矢印を引く。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "cLH3xF9RdVBlhkihPBGuY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11624.749399707316,
      "y": -8.5632812726451,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c91R",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1346308069,
      "version": 243,
      "versionNonce": 30519494,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768454846170,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "「どこから説明／開発を始めるべきか」の順序決めに使う。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "「どこから説明／開発を始めるべきか」の順序決めに使う。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "NCC_nXTlqkDA4yL0b5hoc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 23634.800394580365,
      "y": 92.2368896257924,
      "width": 99.89997863769531,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c91S",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 222878245,
      "version": 400,
      "versionNonce": 32712346,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768454846170,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "MOCK",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "MOCK",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "hEGg3JMKcTmLuDQXF6kii",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 23693.550409839154,
      "y": 169.23685910821428,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c91T",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 566455211,
      "version": 441,
      "versionNonce": 657172486,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768454846170,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "スケッチより具体的な画面モックを作る。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "スケッチより具体的な画面モックを作る。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "G66ezDfkdkxsB2GfLJBRJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 23695.55047087431,
      "y": 201.73685910821428,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c91U",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1597683845,
      "version": 438,
      "versionNonce": 1892107098,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768454846170,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "実際に操作するイメージで流れを検証したいときに使う。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "実際に操作するイメージで流れを検証したいときに使う。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "3AmjafqysLQSgqGLEB6Mb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 24773.89901976347,
      "y": 76.23715283990373,
      "width": 114.65997314453125,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c91V",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1435214827,
      "version": 351,
      "versionNonce": 1422178118,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768454846170,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "SPIKE",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "SPIKE",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "vJYNZQ1FMkESLyUdOfETu",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 24826.749094531537,
      "y": 147.7371108782338,
      "width": 756,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c91W",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1162633419,
      "version": 347,
      "versionNonce": 1350158362,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768454846170,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "技術的に「本当にできるか？」リスク検証のため、コードや設計を短時間で試作し\nてみる。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "技術的に「本当にできるか？」リスク検証のため、コードや設計を短時間で試作してみる。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "85dqKY-5Tdt2ia_quENWN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 24839.749155566693,
      "y": 215.73710324883928,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c91X",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1287595365,
      "version": 375,
      "versionNonce": 1660542598,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768454846170,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "問題が広がりすぎないか、作業量が見えるかを確かめる。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "問題が広がりすぎないか、作業量が見えるかを確かめる。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Az_6OGIX3gbApvYvHUtB5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1564.667547821287,
      "y": 941.9852197661289,
      "width": 401.639892578125,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c91Y",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1746951976,
      "version": 1645,
      "versionNonce": 1224586458,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768454846170,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "※参考\n　IBM　Composer :　Ctrl + V : 横ペースト\n　Quirk : Shift + クリック : 横ペースト\n ",
