      "versionNonce": 1699858566,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768454846171,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "6. 連続操作\n概要",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "6. 連続操作\n概要",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "EsoooeYO3QJu5iXeFXpaf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 14829.511715924165,
      "y": 3008.0310319784944,
      "width": 616,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c9KO",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 977065557,
      "version": 275,
      "versionNonce": 670132954,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768454846171,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "編集効率を高めるための複製・ペースト連続処理\n\n主要ポイント\n\n・キー連打で、基準ゲートに連続して複製可能",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "編集効率を高めるための複製・ペースト連続処理\n\n主要ポイント\n\n・キー連打で、基準ゲートに連続して複製可能",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
